/**
 * GENERATED — the MingCute icons the glass icon set is drawn from.
 *
 * Each glass icon (keyed by its Figma name, "Category - Name") was taken
 * apart into its two layers (src/glassRebuild.ts) and each layer matched
 * against every MingCute glyph, line and fill, by overlap. Only near-exact
 * matches are kept: 93% overlap and clear of the runner-up, or 97%. A layer
 * without one is left out, and opens in the builder as the icon's own shape.
 *
 * 115 icons have at least one layer linked, 39 have both.
 */
